Z||000011||Standard||06-30-2001||03:35 AM||||Those are RCC coilovers on the rear.  There's a few companies that offer coilovers or coilover conversions.. Ground Control is the only other company I can think of off the top of my head right now.  <P>You only need the smaller diameter springs if you go to a wheel wider than 8" or 9", I think.  The main advantage is they are fully adjustable for ride height.||||reg||1
